// See [ph.doc::Synthetics#simulation-overview] chapter.
BaselineSimScenario: SimScenario { simBaseline }

// See [ph.doc::Synthetics#simulation-overview] chapter.
OperationSimScenario: SimScenario { simOperation }

// See [ph.doc::Synthetics#simulation-overview] chapter.
